'''Truant Angel''' (サボったエンジェル, ''Sabotta Enjeru'', '''Truant Angel''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Strong" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Truant Angel|"Strong" Effects Up (Sm)|Almighty Lucifer|Cat Cactus|jpname=サボったエンジェル}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This Combo appears to be based around a pun that was lost in translation: <u>サボったエン</u>ジェル ''<u>sabotta en</u>jeru'' (truant angel) sounds similar to サボテン ''saboten'' (cactus).
**Additionally, サボる ''saboru'' (to be truant) and its conjugations are derived from the French word ''sabotage'', so it might involve [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] being used to stall [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Devils/Demons]] like [[Lucifer the Fallen (Uber Rare Cat)|Lucifer]].

